 "about_text": "Dominique Porter Gallery is a contemporary art gallery in Los Angeles presenting emerging and mid-career artists working across painting, sculpture, and installation. Established in 2026, the gallery supports practices marked by sustained material exploration, formal invention, and individual vision. Its program is built around exhibitions, projects, and collaborations intended to give artists room to develop ambitious work and to engage in dialogue with one another and with wider cultural conversations. The gallery describes its approach as artist-centered, bringing together a range of practices while keeping exhibition-making thoughtful and considered rather than driven by a single house style.",
